	(text "+1V8\nFPGA VCCIO\nbanka 6/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 219 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "03ea1aaf-be5a-4a04-877f-8378ebe0bdfb")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "128363e9-d69c-49d0-bb58-c298ac22d60c")
	)
	(text "FPGA VCCAUX\nZORUNLU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "155702d2-95b9-423c-8667-c6b82c139735")
	)
	(text "GIRIS VE KORUMA — NETLIST.md §9\n9-18 V aku ya da tezgah kaynagi. Ters polarite sahada bir kere olur, yeter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27b89e44-ab3c-4452-a344-60aac5ca4b69")
	)
	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "312bbff1-c7a6-4331-9896-f526596a3e29")
	)
	(text "U6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO'nun TEK beslemesi. Ferrit boncuk, ayri toprak adasi.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3ec5a687-53c0-4f64-a8b6-df3356f02858")
	)
	(text "ANA RAY +3V3 — TPS62130, 3-17V giris, 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4919cb1f-7b72-4afe-bb26-98b0b6594490")
	)
	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "61f09901-c027-4447-bbfc-4e4e2d135704")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ab17d6d-9f9d-49ad-b6e2-b238689da5e9")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82c203f1-d205-4371-874f-b50305add1dc")
	)
	(text "ADC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9426e2fc-1df1-44a0-a184-7da559f09f1a")
	)
	(text "AYRISTIRMA (NETLIST.md §1)\nher ECP5 VCC/VCCIO topu 100nF, viasi dogrudan duzleme · ECP5 toplu 4x10uF + 2x47uF\nADC AVDD x8 pin basina 100nF + toplu 10uF · ADC DRVDD x4 100nF\nVCXO 100nF + 10uF + FERRIT BONCUK · PHY 10uF X5R  (Y5V KULLANMA, datasheet s.46-53)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f4aeaac-244a-4538-a752-b41b32e1e838")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8 x (1 + R3/R4).  3.3V icin oran 3.125\nL1, Cin ve Cout datasheet Tablo 8'den."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a54fa177-26d6-4662-8e03-e5503b2e78c0")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b18693a2-3223-460e-8cf7-96b3c351d59b")
	)
